<!doctype html>
{{.Notice}}
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>How big a VPS do you need? · Playkeeper</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Pick how many friends play at once and what you'll run, and get a starting size for your Minecraft VPS: memory, CPU cores, disk and network, each with its reason.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://playkeeper.io/sizing">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/sizing.css">
  <noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="/sizing-nojs.css"></noscript>
  <script src="/sizing-data.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/sizing.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/copy.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip" href="#guide">Skip to the guide</a>
  <header class="top">
    <a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/playkeeper-mark.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28"><span>Playkeeper</span></a>
    <button type="button" class="menu-button" id="menu-button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-nav">
      <svg class="icon-menu" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2 3h12M2 8h12M2 13h12"/></svg>
      <svg class="icon-close" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
      <span class="visually-hidden">Menu</span>
    </button>
    <nav class="site-nav" id="site-nav" aria-label="Playkeeper">
      <a href="/demo/">Live demo</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/CIYAhq/playkeeper#readme">Docs</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/CIYAhq/playkeeper">GitHub</a>
      <a class="button" href="/#install"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 15V3M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5"/></svg>Install</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="guide">
    <h1>How big a VPS do you need?</h1>
    <p class="lead">Memory matters most, then fast CPU cores, then disk.</p>
    <p class="nojs-note">Turn on JavaScript to answer the two questions, or find your size in the table below.</p>

    <div class="guide">
      <div class="card questions">
        <fieldset class="friends">
          <legend><span class="wide-only">How many friends play at the same time?</span><span class="phone-only">Friends at the same time</span></legend>
          <div class="segments">
            {{- range .Bands}}
            <input type="radio" name="friends" id="friends-{{.Key}}" value="{{.Key}}"{{if .Checked}} checked{{end}}><label for="friends-{{.Key}}">{{.Label}}</label>
            {{- end}}
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="run" id="run">
          <legend id="run-legend">What will you run?</legend>
          <button type="button" class="run-button" id="run-button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="run-options" aria-labelledby="run-legend run-current">
            <span id="run-current">{{.RunLabel}}</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m8 9 4-4 4 4M8 15l4 4 4-4"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="run-options" id="run-options">
            <span class="grabber" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <div class="sheet-head">
              <p class="sheet-title" id="sheet-title" aria-hidden="true">What will you run?</p>
              <button type="button" class="sheet-close" id="sheet-close">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
                <span class="visually-hidden">Close</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="run-list">
              {{- range .Workloads}}
              <input type="radio" name="run" id="run-{{.Key}}" value="{{.Key}}"{{if .Checked}} checked{{end}}>
              <label for="run-{{.Key}}"><span class="name">{{.Label}}</span> <span class="desc">{{.Description}}</span><svg class="check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></label>
              {{- end}}
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <p class="card-foot">These are starting points.</p>
      </div>

      <section class="card answer" aria-labelledby="answer-title">
        <div class="answer-head">
          <img src="/pip-wave.svg" alt="" width="72" height="72">
          <div>
            <h2 id="answer-title"><span class="wide-only" id="answer-long">{{.Answer.Title}}</span><span class="phone-only" id="answer-short">{{.Answer.Short}}</span></h2>
            <p class="summary" id="answer-summary">{{.Answer.Summary}}</p>
            <p class="specs" id="answer-specs" aria-hidden="true">{{.Answer.Specs}}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <dl class="reasons">
          {{- range .Answer.Reasons}}
          <div class="reason"><dt>{{.Label}}</dt><dd><strong>{{.Value}}</strong> <span class="reason-text">{{.Text}}</span></dd></div>
          {{- end}}
        </dl>
        <p class="card-foot">Already running? Settings suggests memory from real use.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <p class="visually-hidden" role="status" id="answer-status"></p>

    <section class="sizes" aria-labelledby="sizes-title">
      <h2 id="sizes-title">Every size at a glance</h2>
      <div class="card table-card">
        <table>
          <caption class="visually-hidden">Memory, CPU cores and disk for each number of friends at once and what they run</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr><th scope="col">Friends at once</th>{{range .Workloads}}<th scope="col">{{.Label}}</th>{{end}}</tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {{- range .Rows}}
            <tr><th scope="row">{{.Band}}</th>{{range .Cells}}<td id="{{.ID}}"><span class="mem">{{.Memory}}<span class="visually-hidden">,</span></span> <span class="more"><span class="part">{{.Cores}}</span><span class="visually-hidden">,</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"> · </span><span class="part">{{.Disk}}</span></span></td>{{end}}</tr>
            {{- end}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="fine">Playkeeper itself needs at least {{.Min.Cores}} CPU cores, {{.Min.MemoryGB}} GB of memory and {{.Min.DiskGB}} GB of free disk. Sizes are memory for the whole VPS. More than {{.Most}} friends at once? Start with the biggest size and watch the Overview.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="more-servers" aria-labelledby="several-title">
      <h2 id="several-title">More than one server on the VPS?</h2>
      <p>They add up, stopped servers too.</p>
      <dl class="rules">
        <div><dt>Memory</dt><dd>Add up what each server gets for the world, then {{.SystemGB}} GB for Ubuntu, Docker and Playkeeper once, and pick the next size up.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>CPU</dt><dd>The busiest server's cores, plus one for each other server.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Disk</dt><dd>Add up each server's.</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p>{{.Example}}</p>
    </section>

    <section class="install" aria-labelledby="install-title">
      <h2 id="install-title">Got your VPS? Install Playkeeper</h2>
      <p>On Ubuntu 24.04 LTS (x86_64), as a user who can use sudo:</p>
      <div class="cmd">
        <pre tabindex="0" aria-label="Install command"><code id="command">{{.Command}}</code></pre>
        <button type="button" id="copy" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2"/><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"/></svg>Copy</button>
      </div>
      <p class="status" id="copy-status" role="status"></p>
      <p><a href="/#install">What the install does</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer>Not an official Minecraft product. Not approved by or associated with Mojang or Microsoft.</footer>
  <div class="backdrop" id="backdrop" hidden></div>
</body>
</html>
